    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107-a2">

                <pb facs="0254" n="158" xml:id="pg158"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 146 <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >bis.</hi>—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Moncrieff to Mr.
                            Williamson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 25, 1874</date>.
                        (Received at Guatemala April 25, 10¼ a.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Detention of ship very detrimental. Large number of passengers. If no answer
                    within twenty-four hours, will consider myself at liberty to sail.</p>
                <closer><signed>A. D. MONCRIEFF,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Agent Pacific Mail
                            Steamship Company.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
